  "details": "This requests for the ability to create a variable of exposed enum types in UdonGraph.\n\nUdonGraph currently cannot make a variable of a variety of enum types such as:\n\n* EventTiming - For SendCustomEventDelayedSeconds and SendCustomEventDelayedFrames\n\n* QueryTriggerInteraction - For Physics > Raycast and similar\n\n* HumanBodyBones - For VRCPlayerApi > GetBonePosition and VRCPlayerApi > GetBoneRotation\n\n* VRCPlayerApi.TrackingDataType - For VRCPlayerApi > GetTrackingData\n\nUdonSharp is able to make variables of all of the listed enum types above and more.",
